/Title (The transform is three nested loops. The outer loop steps through the 7 layers, halving the stride each time. The middle loop walks the blocks in a layer and draws one new twiddle factor per block. The inner loop issues the butterflies, which are independent inside a layer.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 767 0 R
/Prev 782 0 R
/Next 805 0 R
>>
